{"blocks":[{"t":"p","html":"As we start to slowly re-open businesses and resume travel gradually, we at Go Hotels are prepared and ready to welcome you back."},{"t":"p","html":"With Robinsons Hotels and Resorts’ Happy to Care initiative and the new Circle of Clean program, we are upping the ante on our cleanliness and hygiene standards so that you can stay with peace of mind."},{"t":"p","html":"We are here when you are ready to <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/goexploremore?__eep__=6&source=feed_text&epa=HASHTAG&__xts__%5B0%5D=68.ARDNBVSSVVGJt3-eyL9IPdSynjy4fi3ghnLQ76l5-t63pL3QMNkr2ZkfFLK8VPOBqPyQldjmT-mHnX6TeO4YoBaV_aglpbEE7t7IUDRAP5Q37eBXUyi4EI-CU21A7piDUo12CPI-o1yGuADYxGMJjHWHgMz5Ni15vIydL7-k2QfYrSLDEurTTcfb5BkERt615S_uzzqzdu3rTLyrFYDLA6pCN85JlJkcjs2soC6Q1a1rVgpUavtnkySGHZ4TBf-vX69CPS3TQOkVG2UUQBy5TZSW46vI0CnNq_OkPvdz9Lrrv6JpcgPHUbz_DzHNjm_Pcih95ZkND_cyaOH3TvXoyRrsMskC-pEC&__tn__=%2ANK-R\">#GoExploreMore</a> again!"},{"t":"p","html":"Visit our official website and join our Viber Community Group to be updated with the efforts we’re implementing for our customers, colleagues, company, and communities."},{"t":"p","html":"Website: <a href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FGOHCircleofClean%3Ffbclid%3DIwAR3eaTqBHIDW6j8CTAWgUcwOsF3LB1F9TjYQ2vAek01bThe_u3mllJqV5kM&h=AT2WSydwHoV0olLBDcZxLyDajNCKHQAyElaJwgACC24ehOBF9viqtoO0nVAL8jmb5QVpJYX72hMjZogFfleyDp8wQJ3nZxZ2N_2FAZlr2eXnT5-CrGCgqKDQahoAnW_BXGMongetqWO9evmmCGhD7xHHYTh8WJW4n11FWcdERIYq4xrFQsWUNg7FZMxbiCiGlW3aJpkoQiJMSJ3vN5K4TBbved8EV3bwj-Z3Y75q8kv_8LJqX8llvKACTMTJUhYbYwSGPfm9RcWq31EMD4RXxxRuuu-T2AAePTj5JnV8uFcZkiBFQVUAxYxR3-mNK5R-8rebejiNnKPJ-EThoeo7f4cgkWjzvojLhwQf8Skrg4M53yklrpR_NC_Py70Wl1gEcJY0XAt67EGzBjJ2Q28Xeidr7lnohFvOZdIzCLmlhCt2LVqyZcGsWnwqlb23iN3u5ohJUgrUxLzTm_1aAOIuahV5ANmJOVe4cfpmoWf8s2BI1GPWIRAew4JausQP0o352iW__8Fe9DUALYlzJp3c693jl0hfMQPrqLx3okzrYwqQIflsZM5OlT4EzCf1tzjshJzkl9zNeSvKBYqGYlu0rgZlXy0yHrSFJgqS-H3O-DAIGkEGCR_HVZSF0v3XzwtVGb8dpTy-\">https://bit.ly/GOHCircleofClean</a>